// --- Domain: people ---

// ============================================================================
// People domain (PEOPLE-1 — People Foundation, Master Roadmap Phase 4)
//
// Authoritative design source: engineering/People Engineering.md §7 (frozen)
// with the §18-approved architecture decisions:
//   • Person is the root identity aggregate; role sub-types (Student, Staff,
//     Parent, Guardian, Applicant) reference people and add role-specific
//     attributes. Identity attributes live ONLY on people (single source of
//     truth; no denormalized first/last name or gender on sub-types).
//   • Person ↔ User link (approved §18 #3): nullable `userId` bridge on the
//     rebuilt Student/Staff/Parent/Guardian records. `User.personId` is NOT
//     added. Phase-1/2 identity/session architecture remains authoritative.
//   • `publicId` is server-generated, immutable, unique per tenant
//     (P-/STU-/EMP-/APP-YYYY-NNNNNN). Generation foundation: people.utils.
//   • Explicit lifecycle/status enums per table (approved §18 #2).
//   • `internalEmail` and `studentNumber`/`staffNumber` Prisma field names are
//     retained on Student/Staff (mapped to spec columns) because Phase-1 login
//     resolution (auth.service.resolveIdentity) and the identity-b1 e2e suite
//     depend on them. Additive columns, documented in the implementation report.
//   • student_enrollment_details.academic_session_id and
//     student_academic_records.academic_session_id are nullable UUID columns
//     (spec People Engineering §7.2 FK → academic_sessions). Academic Session
//     ownership lives in the Academics domain (frozen-spec deviation D2);
//     PHASE 5 wires the deferred FK relation to the authoritative
//     AcademicSession model (see Migration report §legacy→new mapping).
// ============================================================================

enum PersonStatus {
  ACTIVE
  INACTIVE
}

enum StudentStatus {
  ENROLLED
  ACTIVE
  TRANSFERRED
  WITHDRAWN
  GRADUATED
}

enum StaffStatus {
  HIRED
  ACTIVE
  ON_LEAVE
  SEPARATED
}

enum EmploymentType {
  FULL_TIME
  PART_TIME
